to do with the Blackwood Partners trades. In particular, they haven't
thought through what they want to do with the online trades, don't like on
online documentation, and now they think they may want to do a full novation
of the trades once they decide how to resolve this. So, until we hear back
from them (they said in about a week), just let the Northwood financial
trades and master sit.

